    "detailed_description": "People overwhelmed with fear in a cursed place ask you, a psychic, for exorcism.<br>A cursed space. And from there, the cursed canvas coming towards you...<br>This canvas captures the fear that lies deep within your heart...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699380/extras/1fd36c7c46b412214f5270d66528d18e.avif?t=1708915760\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>Cursed Canvas is a single-player horror game. Players explore various cursed locations to perform exorcism rituals.<br>In places full of darkness, only a flashlight can help you see. Flashlight batteries deplete over time, and if the batteries run out, your exorcism will be a failure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699380/extras/c43414b442d45bb8dfad301201daef80.avif?t=1708915760\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span><br><br>As you try to find haunted objects in a cursed place to lift the curse, the cursed canvas approaches you at every moment...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699380/extras/c9366d2631d9b2defbfe33aceab6c50a.avif?t=1708915760\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span><br><br>If the Cursed Canvas finds you, you will have to face the canvas containing the horrors of the abyss. And the cursed canvas will eat away at your fear-ridden mind. However, as a competent psychic, you can see the weak points of the Cursed Canvas and spray holy water on them to push them away.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699380/extras/5a1d131210182de66144d833080ae4c5.avif?t=1708915760\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span><br><br>Find and destroy the haunted object before your soul is consumed by the cursed canvas! That is the only way to salvation...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699380/extras/d2a6a4f361c29421514c5681dc20be72.avif?t=1708915760\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>",
